# project: newsletter-media-business
VAR month = 0
VAR hit_streak = 0
VAR miss_streak = 0

-> growth_cycle

=== growth_cycle ===
Run a monthly growth experiment cycle toward 20k subscribers.
Launch experiments, measure, keep what works, kill what doesn't.
~ month += 1
+ [Hit 20k subscribers] -> choose_mix
+ {month < 8} [Not there yet, run another cycle] ~loop~ -> growth_cycle
+ {month >= 8} [Eight months in, still under 20k] @human -> eight_month_call

=== eight_month_call ===
Eight months without hitting 20k: my call on whether this is still worth it.
* [Lower the bar and monetize anyway] @human -> choose_mix
* [Shelve the whole idea] @human -> END

=== choose_mix ===
Pick the monetization mix for the newsletter.
+ [Sponsorships only] @human -> sponsorship_prep
+ [Paid tier only] @human -> paid_tier_prep
+ [Both sponsorships and paid tier] @human -> both_prep

=== sponsorship_prep ===
Build the sponsorship offer: publish a rate card and warm up a sponsor
pipeline before running the first campaign.
+ [Rate card done and five-plus warm sponsor conversations] -> revenue_operation

=== paid_tier_prep ===
Bank three months of weekly premium content before launching the paid tier.
+ [Three months of premium content banked, tier launched] -> revenue_operation

=== both_prep ===
Do both preps: rate card plus five-plus warm sponsor conversations, and
three months of weekly premium content banked.
+ [Both tracks ready, campaigns and paid tier live] -> revenue_operation

=== revenue_operation ===
Run the monetization mix for a month and measure revenue against target.
This is the first revenue month both paths converge on.
+ [Month came in at target] -> at_target_month
+ [Month came in below target] -> below_target_month

=== at_target_month ===
A month at target: extend the hit streak and reset the miss streak.
~ hit_streak += 1
~ miss_streak = 0
+ {hit_streak >= 2} [Two consecutive months at target] -> incorporate
+ {hit_streak < 2} [Keep operating, one more month] ~loop~ -> revenue_operation

=== below_target_month ===
A month below target: extend the miss streak and reset the hit streak.
~ miss_streak += 1
~ hit_streak = 0
+ {miss_streak < 3} [Keep pushing with the current mix] ~loop~ -> revenue_operation
+ {miss_streak >= 3} [Missed three months running, change the mix] @human ~loop~ -> choose_mix

=== incorporate ===
Incorporate the business: the newsletter is now my job.
* [Incorporated, this is the job now] @human -> END
